      {
        "content": "A student whose special-educational-needs support was already established in another federal state can be admitted to a Hamburg school without a fresh assessment.",
        "citation": {
          "document_id": "apo-grundstgy",
          "document_title": "Ausbildungs- und Prüfungsordnungen (APO-GrundStGy / VO-BF / AO-SF)",
